    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">30 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Expand around centre</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Interval DP</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/longest-palindromic-substring/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 5</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Longest Palindromic Substring</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Every palindrome has a centre, and there are only 2n - 1 of them (n chars + n - 1 gaps). Grow outwards from each centre while both ends match and keep the longest. O(n²) time, O(1) space; the DP table gives the same time with O(n²) space, and Manacher's O(n) is rarely expected.</p>\n"
  },
